        "content": "Adapted from public [14396 revision 1](https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/14396-system-metrics-for-the-linux-hosts/) for InfraPulse Telegraf push metrics. Select **one server_id and one agent_id**, then mounts/interfaces. No data is unknown, not healthy zero. Metrics age uses sample timestamps, not Management Online status; agents never scrape into `up`. OS/host tags are descriptive, not authenticated inventory. CPU/RAM/disk/metrics-stale alerts are evaluated globally, **independent of dashboard filters**. A slower custom profile needs a correspondingly larger network query Min step/rate window. See deployment documentation for thresholds, No Data and 24h stale-discovery limits."
